            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–14</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The company is having this meeting about fire procedures because",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "employees did badly in the last annual fire drill."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "there have been changes in the building layout."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "new staff have joined the company."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;There has been a recent upgrade to",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "the sprinkler system."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "the fire extinguishers."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "the alarm system."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;During the minor fire in January, some staff working in the factory",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "were unable to read fire notices."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "left fire doors open."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "were unwilling to start the fire alarm."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;In the fire in January, the problem with office staff was that they",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "refused to leave personal items behind."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "moved too slowly during the evacuation."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "did not move far away enough from the building."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
